OL,3,AUK growth forecast upgraded but higher
OL,4,Aenergy prices to hit economy next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FEconomies across the world have proved
OL,7,Fmore resilient to the energy price
OL,8,Fshock caused by the US-Iran war, the
OL,9,FIMF said, but it warned the economic
OL,10,Ffallout from the conflict remained
OL,11,F"highly uncertain".
OL,13,FChancellor John Healey said the
OL,14,Fgovernment would look to "provide some
OL,15,Fbreathing space" for households in the
OL,16,FBudget.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
